/P 126 0 R
/E (The main purpose of PIXEL is to bring multiple image processing operations into a single application. Users can upload or capture an image and apply various operations such as Grayscale Conversion, RGB to HSV Conversion, Histogram Analysis, Brightness and Contrast Adjustment, Image Filtering, Edge Detection, Laplacian Sharpening, Binary Image Processing, and Morphological Operations.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
207 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
